      way to reach any of them was to edit ?rule= in the address bar — and even
      then `buildPath` had no case for them and read the grid in plain rows.
      Both halves are fixed; these are the readings whose poems he quotes, so
      each one has been checked against his own text.

      The label defaults are inline because these keys are not in the locale
      files, which is how the rest of this application handles a key that has
      no translation yet.
